@KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213

GET {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### ── 레시피 목록
GET {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes

### ── 레시피 상세 (라면)
GET {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1

### ✅ 정상: 라면에 4단계 추가
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/steps
Content-Type: application/json

{ "machineId": 4, "action": "그릇에 담기", "durationMinutes": 1 }

### ❌ 없는 기계
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/steps
Content-Type: application/json

{ "machineId": 999, "action": "테스트", "durationMinutes": 1 }

### ❌ 소요 시간 0
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/steps
Content-Type: application/json

{ "machineId": 4, "action": "테스트", "durationMinutes": 0 }

### 🗑️ 단계 삭제: 라면의 "그릇에 담기"(id 22)
DELETE {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/steps/22

### ❌ 없는 단계 삭제
DELETE {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/steps/999

### ── T5 실행 전 검사: 라면 (정상 → violations 빈 배열)
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/validate

### ── T5 실행 전 검사: 없는 레시피 → 404
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/999/validate
### ── T6 순차: 라면 (0~5, 5~6, 6~10)
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1/simulate

### ── T6 순차: 야채볶음 (6단계)
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/2/simulate

### ── T6 순차: 로스트치킨 (12단계)
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/3/simulate

### ── T6 순차: 없는 레시피 → 404
POST {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/999/simulate

### ── 비교: T4 병렬 스케줄 (야채볶음)
GET {{KitchenFlow_Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/2/schedule
